{
  "slug": "agent-discovery",
  "name": "Agent Discovery",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent Discovery lets developers discover, review, install, and manage AI agent configurations from a curated catalog of 687+ entries — with zero setup. It ships a pre-built SQLite index of agents, skills, and instructions from awesome-copilot and GitHub's Agent Factory, so search is instant and requires no API keys or authentication. The interactive /recommend flow analyzes your project's tech stack, surfaces relevant agents with explanations, then guides you through reviewing content before installing, customizing in your editor, or assembling multiple agents into a coordinated team with an agentic lead. Additional /list and /edit commands let you manage everything you've installed without leaving Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `edit` (Edit an installed agent, skill, instruction, or team), `list` (List installed agents, skills, instructions, and teams), `recommend` (Discover, review, and install AI agents — or assemble them into a coordinated team)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `agent-discovery`, `github`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-discovery@claude-community` from `svmnikhil/agent-discovery`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
